\begin{tabularx}{\linewidth}{@{}L{1.3cm}L{5.2cm}L{2.2cm}Y@{}}
\toprule\textbf{ID} & \textbf{Finding} & \textbf{Status} & \textbf{Retest evidence}\\\midrule
F01 & Partial award possible with raw SQL & \fixed & \code{deep-db.json} DB04\\
F02 & Anonymous lockout of a known account & \fixed & \code{auth-retest.json} F02\\
F03 & Locked-account timing gap & \fixed & \code{auth-retest.json} F03, \code{timing.csv}\\
F04 & No source throttle & \fixed & \code{auth-retest.json} F04\\
F05 & Permissions-Policy missing & \fixed & \code{auth-retest.json} F05\\
